  aliases: ['parchment', 'pergamino'],
  "short": 'The papery shell around a coffee seed. Coffee rests and ships inside it, then is hulled before export.',
  deep: 'Once the fruit and mucilage are gone, the seed is still wrapped in this dry husk, which protects it during storage.[1] Hulling \u2014 removing the parchment \u2014 usually happens as late as possible, just before the coffee leaves for the roaster.',
