  term: 'Green Coffee',
  cat: 'processing',
  aliases: ['green coffee', 'green bean', 'green beans'],
  "short": 'Coffee as it leaves the farm and ships: dried, hulled, unroasted seeds \u2014 pale green, hard, and smelling of hay.',
  deep: 'Everything before the roaster happens to green coffee, and everything after is the roaster\u2019s work on it. Green keeps for months in a sack, which is why it, not roasted coffee, is what gets graded, traded and shipped.[1]',
  related: ['parchment', 'washed', 'first-crack', 'specialty'],
