  deep: 'Not a roast level and not a bean \u2014 a brewing method. Pressure does in 25\u201330 seconds what a filter brew takes minutes to do, giving a syrupy cup several times stronger than drip, topped with crema.[1] Everything milk drinks are built on starts here. A typical modern shot: 18 g of coffee in, about 36 g of liquid out, in roughly 28 seconds.',
