    explain: 'A bag ages by a day, loses more gas, and takes up whatever moisture is in the air, so the same setting meets slightly different coffee. Dialling in is following a target that keeps moving, which is why you change one thing \u2014 the grind \u2014 and leave dose and yield alone.'
