  deep: 'Crema forms when pressurised water forces oils and gases into a fine emulsion.[1] It\u2019s a sign of fresh coffee and a well-pulled shot, though it isn\u2019t the whole story of quality.',
  related: ['portafilter', 'robusta', 'channeling'],
