  term: 'Cupping',
  cat: 'sensory',
  aliases: ['cupping', 'cupping table', 'cup score'],
  "short": 'The industry\u2019s standard tasting method: same grind, same water, no filter \u2014 slurped from a spoon and scored.',
  deep: 'Grounds steep in a bowl, the crust is broken, and tasters slurp across many bowls side by side. Holding every variable but the coffee still lets buyers compare lots fairly, and the 100-point score that comes out of it is what puts a coffee above the specialty line.[1] A lot cupping at 86 points sells as specialty; one at 78 goes into commodity blends.',
